<title>HUNGARY: Polish shares push CESI index a little higher.</title>
<headline>Polish shares push CESI index a little higher.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index rose on Tuesday to close at 1,498.68 points, up 5.50 points or 0.37 percent, the Budapest Stock Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index rose mainly because rises on the Polish bourse.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflects the trends of 50 shares on the Budapest, Prague and Warsaw bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
